## Mermaid Rules

| Do | Avoid |
|----|----|
| `classDiagram` for structure | God-class diagrams with 15+ classes |
| `sequenceDiagram` for one runtime path | Unquoted special chars in labels |
| camelCase node IDs | Using `Redis`/`Kafka` as ambiguous node IDs |

