## Workflow

1. Add topic slug to `data/design_patterns_modules.yaml`
2. Create `content/design-patterns/<slug>.md` using the template above
3. Put **all** implementation code inside `impl-tabs` / `impl-tab`
4. Update `content/design-patterns/_index.md` curriculum tables if module structure changes
5. Preview: `hugo server -D` — hard refresh (`Ctrl+Shift+R`)
6. Set `draft: false` when ready

### Preview checklist (every LLD post)

| Check | Expected |
|---|---|
| `### Implementation` | Single section heading (not Java/Go split headings) |
| Tab bar | **Java**, **Go**, and **Python** buttons visible server-rendered in HTML |
| Default panel | Java code visible on load without clicking |
| Go tab click | Switches panel; Go code visible; Java panel hidden |
| Long code | Scrolls inside tab panel, not full-page stretch |
| Shortcodes | View source — no raw `{< impl-tabs` text |
| Console | No errors on tab switch |

Spot-check reference posts: `single-responsibility-principle.md`, `strategy-pattern.md`.

